    "section": "63",
    "title": "Amount of fine",
    "description": "Amount of fine\n\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL\nCODE, 1860\nACT NO. XLV OF 1860\nCHAPTER III OF\nPUNISHMENTS\n63. Amount of fine. Where no sum is expressed to which a\nfine may extend, the amount of fine to which the offender is liable is\nunlimited, but shall not be excessive.\n(Enforcement\nof Hadd) Order (P.O. No. 4 of 1979), Offence of Zina (Enforcement of Hudood)\nOrdinance (VII of 1979) and Offence of Qazf (Enforcement of Hadd) Ordinance\n(VIII of 1979).",
