    "title": "Unlawfully faking coining instrument from mint",
    "description": "Unlawfully faking coining instrument from mint\n\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nACT NO. XLV OF 1860.\nCHAPTER XII OF OFFENCES RELATING TO COINS AND GOVERNMENT STAMPS\n245. Unlawfully taking coining instrument\nfrom mint. Whoever, without lawful' authority, takes out of any mint,\nlawfully established in Pakistan, any coining tool or instrument, shall be\npunished with imprisonment of either description for a term which may extend to\nseven years, and shall also be liable to fine.",
    "punishment": "shall be\npunished with imprisonment of either description for a term which may extend to\nseven years, and shall also be liable to fine.",
