    "statute": "Pakistan Penal Code 1860",
    "section": "282",
    "title": "Conveying person by water for hire in unsafe or overloaded vessel",
    "description": "Conveying person by water for hire in unsafe or overloaded vessel\n\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nACT NO. XLV OF 1860.\nCHAPTER XIV OF OFFENCES AFFECTING THE PUBLIC HEALTH SAFETY,\nCONVENIENCE, DECENCY AND MORALS\n282. Conveying person by water for hire in\nunsafe or overloaded vessel Whoever knowingly or negligently conveys, or\ncauses to be conveyed for hire an person by water in any vessel, when that\nvessel is in such a state or so loaded as to endanger the life of that person,\nshall be punished with imprisonment of either description for a term which may\nextend to six months or with fine which may extend to one thousand rupees, or\nwith both.",
    "punishment": "shall be punished with imprisonment of either description for a term which may\nextend to six months or with fine which may extend to one thousand rupees, or\nwith both.",
