    "description": "Negligent conduct with respect to explosive substance\n\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nACT NO. XLV OF 1860.\nCHAPTER XIV OF OFFENCES AFFECTING THE PUBLIC HEALTH SAFETY,\nCONVENIENCE, DECENCY AND MORALS\n286. Negligent conduct with respect to\nexplosive substance. Whoever does, any explosive substance, any act so\nrashly or negligently as to endanger human life or to be likely to cause hurt\nor injury to any other person, or knowingly or negligently omits to take such\norder with any explosive substance in his possession as is sufficient to guard\nagainst any probable danger to human life from that substance;\nshall be\npunished with imprisonment of either description for a term which may extend to\nsix months or with fine, which may extend to one thousand rupees; or",
