    "id": "ppc-396",
    "statute": "Pakistan Penal Code 1860",
    "section": "396",
    "title": "Voluntarily causing hurt in committing robbery",
    "description": "Voluntarily causing hurt in committing robbery\n\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nACT NO. XLV OF 1860.\nCHAPTER XVII OF OFFENCES AGAINST\nPROPERTY\nOf Robbery and Dacoity\n396. Dacoity with murder. If any one of\nfive or more persons, who are conjointly committing dacoity, commits murder in\nso committing dacoity, every one of those persons shall be punished with death,\nor imprisonment for life, or rigorous imprisonment for a term which [Subs. by\nOrdinance III of 1980.][shall not be less than four years nor more than] ten\nyears, and shall also be liable to fine.",
