    "description": "Robbery or dacoity with intent to cause death or grievous hurt\n\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nACT NO. XLV OF 1860.\nCHAPTER XVII OF OFFENCES AGAINST\nPROPERTY\nOf Robbery and Dacoity\n398. Attempt to commit robbery or dacoity when\narmed with deadly weapon. If, at the time of attempting to commit robbery or\ndacoity, the offender is armed with any deadly weapon, the imprisonment with\nwhich such offender shall be punished shall not be less than seven years.",
