    "id": "ppc-399",
    "statute": "Pakistan Penal Code 1860",
    "section": "399",
    "title": "Attempt to commit robbery or dacoity when armed with deadly weapon",
    "description": "Attempt to commit robbery or dacoity when armed with deadly weapon\n\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nACT NO. XLV OF 1860.\nCHAPTER XVII OF OFFENCES AGAINST\nPROPERTY\nOf Robbery and Dacoity\n399. Making preparation to commit dacoity.\nWhoever makes any preparation for committing dacoity, shall be punished with\nimprisonment for life or with rigorous imprisonment for a term which may extend\nto ten years, and shall also be liable to fine.\nNotes: Preparation consists in devising or\narranging means and measures necessary for commission of offence. 1990\nP.Cr.L.J. 41.",
