    "title": "Punishment for hijacking",
    "description": "Punishment for hijacking\n\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nACT NO. XLV OF 1860.\nCHAPTER XVII OF OFFENCES AGAINST\nPROPERTY\nOf Robbery and Dacoity\n402-B. Punishment for Hijacking. Whoever\ncommits, or conspires or attempts to commit, or abets the commission of,\nhijacking shall be punished with death or imprisonment for life, and shall also\nbe liable to forfeiture of property and fine.",
