    "title": "Punishment for harbouring hijacking",
    "description": "Punishment for harbouring hijacking\n\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nACT NO. XLV OF 1860.\nCHAPTER XVII OF OFFENCES AGAINST\nPROPERTY\nOf Robbery and Dacoity\n402-C. Punishment for habouring hijacker,\netc. Whoever knowingly harbours any person whom he knows or has reasons to\nbelieve to be a person. who is about to commit or has committed or abetted an\noffence of hijacking, or knowingly permits any such persons to meet or assemble\nin any place or premises in his possession or under his control, shall be\npunished with death or imprisonment for life, and shall also be liable to\nfine\")",
