    "id": "ppc-433",
    "statute": "Pakistan Penal Code 1860",
    "section": "433",
    "title": "Mischief by destroying, moving or rendering less useful a light house or a sea mark",
    "description": "Mischief by destroying, moving or rendering less useful a light house or a sea mark\n\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nACT NO. XLV OF 1860.\nCHAPTER XVII OF OFFENCES AGAINST\nPROPERTY\nOf Fraudulent Deeds and Dispossession of Property\n433. Mischief by destroying, moving or rendering less useful a lighthouse or sea-mark.\nWhoever commits mischief by destroying or moving any light-house or other light\nused as a sea-mark, or any sea-mark or buoy or other thing placed as a guide\nfor navigators, or by any act which renders any such light-house, sea-mark,\nbuoy or other such thing as aforesaid less useful as a guide for navigators,\nshall be punished with imprisonment of either description for a term which may\nextend to seven years, or with fine or with both.",
