    "title": "Punishment for the mischief described in section committed by fire or explosive substance",
    "description": "Punishment for the mischief described in section committed by fire or explosive substance\n\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nACT NO. XLV OF 1860.\nCHAPTER XVII OF OFFENCES AGAINST\nPROPERTY\nOf Fraudulent Deeds and Dispossession of Property\n438. Punishment for the mischief described\nin section 437 committed by fire or\nexplosive substance. Whoever commits, or attempts to commit, by fire\nor any explosive substance, such mischief as is described in the last preceding\nsection, shall be punished with imprisonment for life, or with imprisonment of\neither description for a term which may extend to ten' years and shall also be\nliable to fine.",
