    "id": "ppc-440",
    "statute": "Pakistan Penal Code 1860",
    "section": "440",
    "title": "Mischief committed after preparation made for causing death or hurt",
    "description": "Mischief committed after preparation made for causing death or hurt\n\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nTHE PAKISTAN PENAL CODE, 1860\nACT NO. XLV OF 1860.\nCHAPTER XVII OF OFFENCES AGAINST\nPROPERTY\nOf Fraudulent Deeds and Dispossession of\nProperty\n440. Mischief committed after preparation\nmade for causing death or hurt.\nWhoever commits mischief, having made preparation for causing to any person\ndeath, or hurt, or wrongful restraint, or fear or death or of hurt, or of\nwrongful restraint shall be punished with imprisonment of either description\nfor a term which may extend to five years, and shall also be liable to fine.",
