    "statute": "Criminal Procedure Code Cr P C 1898",
    "section": "25",
    "title": "Ex-officio justice of the peace",
    "description": "Ex-officio justice of the peace\n\nTHE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDURE (ACT V OF 1898)\nTHE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDURE (ACT V OF 1898)\nPART II\nCONSTITUTION AND POWERS OF CRIMINAL COURTS AND OFFENCES\nCHAPTER II\nOF THE CONSTITUTION OF CRIMINAL COURTS AND OFFENCES\nC. Courts and Offices\n25. Ex-officio Justice of the Peace. In virtue of their respective\noffices, the Judges of the High Courts are Justice of the Peace within and for\nthe whole of Pakistan, Sessions Judges and District Magistrates are Justices of\nthe Peace within and for the whole of the territories administered by the\nProvincial Government under which they are serving.",
