    "title": "Control of district Magistrates investing power",
    "description": "Control of district Magistrates investing power\n\nTHE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDURE (ACT V OF 1898)\nTHE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDURE (ACT V OF 1898)\nCHAPTER III POWERS OF\nCOURTS\nC. Ordinary and Additional Powers\n38. Control of District Magistrates investing power. The powers\nconferred on the District Magistrate by section 37 shall be exercised subject\nto the control of the Provincial Government.",
