    "description": "Power of presidency Magistrate to order prisoners in jail to be brought up for examination\n\nTHE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDURE (ACT V OF 1898)\nTHE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDURE (ACT V OF 1898)\nPART IX\nSUPPLEMENTARY PROVISIONS\nCHAPTER XLVI\nMISCELLANEOUS\n542. [Power of Presidency Magistrate to order prisoner in jail to\nbe brought up for examination]: Rep. by the Federal Laws (Revision and\nDeclaration Act, 1951), S. 3 end II Schedule.",
