    "title": "Register to be evidence",
    "description": "Register to be evidence\n\nCOMPANIES ORDINANCE 1984\nCOMPANIES\nORDINANCE 1984\n(ORDINANCE NO. XLVII OF 1984)\n[8th October, 1984]\nAn Ordinance to consolidate and\namend the law relating to companies and certain other associations.\nPART VIII.- REGISTER OF MEMBERS AND DEBENTURE-HOLDERS\n155. Register to be evidence.--The registers referred to in\nsections 76, 147, 149 and 156 shall be prima facie evidence of any matter which\nby this Ordinance is directed or authorised to be inserted therein.",
