    "description": "Validity of acts of directors\n\nCOMPANIES ORDINANCE 1984\nCOMPANIES\nORDINANCE 1984\n(ORDINANCE NO. XLVII OF 1984)\n[8th October, 1984]\nAn Ordinance to consolidate and\namend the law relating to companies and certain other associations.\nPART VIII.- DIRECTORS\n185. Validity of acts of directors.--No act of a director, or of a\nmeeting of directors attended by him, shall be invalid merely on the ground of\nany defect subsequently discovered in his appointment to such office:\nProvided that, as soon as any\nsuch defect has come to notice, the director shall not exercise the right of\nhis office till the defect has been rectified.",
