    "title": "Right of member of company to copies of the balance-sheet etc and the auditor's report",
    "description": "Right of member of company to copies of the balance-sheet etc and the auditor's report\n\nCOMPANIES ORDINANCE 1984\nCOMPANIES\nORDINANCE 1984\n(ORDINANCE NO. XLVII OF 1984)\n[8th October, 1984]\nAn Ordinance to consolidate and\namend the law relating to companies and certain other associations.\nPART VIII.-ACCOUNTS\n243. Right of member of company to copies of the balance-sheets etc.\nand the auditor's report.-- Save as otherwise provided in this Ordinance, a\nmember of a company shall be entitled to be furnished with copies of the\nbalance-sheet and the profit and loss account or the income and expenditure\naccount, the director's report and the auditor's report on payment of such sum\nas the company may fix not exceeding the maximum amount prescribed.",
    "punishment": null,
