    "description": "Signature on audit report etc\n\nCOMPANIES ORDINANCE 1984\nCOMPANIES\nORDINANCE 1984\n(ORDINANCE NO. XLVII OF 1984)\n[8th October, 1984]\nAn Ordinance to consolidate and\namend the law relating to companies and certain other associations.\nPART VIII.- AUDIT\n257. Signature on audit report etc.--(1) Only the person appointed\nas auditor of the company, or where a firm is so appointed in pursuance of\nsubsection (2) of section 254, only a partner in the firm practising in\nPakistan, shall sign the auditors' report or sign or authenticate any other\ndocuments of the company required by law to be signed or authenticated by the\nauditor.\nThe report of auditors shall be\ndated and indicate the place at which it is signed.",
