    "id": "companies-ordinance-355",
    "statute": "Companies Ordinance 1984",
    "section": "355",
    "title": "Power to enforce orders",
    "description": "Power to enforce orders\n\nCOMPANIES ORDINANCE 1984\nCOMPANIES\nORDINANCE 1984\n(ORDINANCE NO. XLVII OF 1984)\n[8th October, 1984]\nAn Ordinance to consolidate and\namend the law relating to companies and certain other associations.\nPART XI. ENFORCEMENT OF ORDERS\n355. Power to enforce orders.\u2011\u2011All orders made by a\nCourt under this Ordinance may be enforced in the same manner in which decrees\nof such Court made in any suit may be enforced.",
