    "id": "companies-ordinance-476",
    "statute": "Companies Ordinance 1984",
    "section": "476",
    "title": "Punishment and adjudication of fine or penalty",
    "description": "Punishment and adjudication of fine or penalty\n\nCOMPANIES ORDINANCE 1984\nCOMPANIES\nORDINANCE 1984\n(ORDINANCE NO. XLVII OF 1984)\n[8th October, 1984]\nAn Ordinance to consolidate and\namend the law relating to companies and certain other associations.\nPART XVI\u2011\u2011GENERAL LEGAL PROCEEDINGS, OFFENCES,\nETC.\n476. Punishment and adjudication\nof fine or penalty.\u2011---(1) Where a fine\n(other titan fine in addition to, or in lieu of, imprisonment) is provided for\nany offence, contravention of, or default in\n*SRO.\n230 (I)/2001 dated 16\u20114\u20112001.\u2011In exercise of the powers\nconferred by subsection (2) of section 476 of the. Companies Ordinance, 1984\n(the Ordinance), and in supersession of the Order No.CO\u2011476(2)/I/85,\ndated 24th July, 1985 of the Corporate Law Authority, the Securities and\nExchange Commission of Pakistan is please' to direct that Executive Director\n(Enforcement Division) shall be empowered to adjudge all offences,\ncontraventions and defaults under any of the following provisions of the\nOrdinance and to impose fine (other than fine in addition to, or in lieu of,\nimprisonment), as specified below namely:\u2011\nS.No.\nSection\nNo.\nNature\nof offence/default\n1\n53(3)\nIssue\nof prospectus in contravention of the provisions of subsection (1) or\nsubsection (2) of section 53.\n2\n53(6)\nIssue\nof application form not accompanied by a prospectus.\n3\n56\nIssue\nof prospectus in contravention of section 54 or 55.\n4\n57(6)\nIssue\nof prospectus, published or circulated, in contravention of section 57.\n5\n67(5)\nContravention\nof subsection (1) or subsection (2), or making an incorrect statement,\ndeclaration or verification in the application of allotment of shares.\n6\n71(2)\nDefault\nin repayment of money for shares pot allotted.\n7\n72(2)\nContravention\nof subsections (1) and (2) of section 72\n8\n72(3)\nContravention\nof subsection (3) of section 72.\n9\n76(7)\nContravention\nof the provisions relating to transfer of shares in the case of a listed\ncompany.\n10\n82(5)\nContravention\nof the provisions relating to payment of commission etc. by a listed company.\n11\n84(5)\nContravention\nof subsection (4) of section 84, in the case of a listed company.\n12\n88(4)\nViolation\nof provisions regarding invitation and acceptance of deposits in the case of\na listed company.\n13\n95(3)\nContravention\nof subsection (1) or subsection (2) of section 95, in the case of a listed\ncompany.\n14\n157(11)(a)\nDefault\nin complying with the provisions of section 157.\n15\n158(4)(a)\nDefault\nin complying with the provisions of section 158.\n16\n159(8)(a)\nDefault\nin complying with the provisions of section 159.\n17\n160(8)(a)\nDefault\nin complying with the provisions of section 160.\n18\n161(10)\nFailure\nto issue timely notices and violation of relevant provisions regarding\ncalling of meetings in the case of a listed company.\n19\n164(3)\nContravention\nof provisions relating to issue of notice for passing a resolution in a\nmeeting of listed company.\n20.\n186\nViolation\nof provisions relating to directors in the case of a listed company.\n21\n189\nPenalty\nfor unqualified person acting as director, etc. in the case of a listed\ncompany.\n22\n193(3)(a)\nViolation\nof provisions relating to proceedings of directors.\n23\n196(4)\nExercise\nof ultra vires\npowers by directors in the case of a\nlisted company.\n24\n204\nContravention\nof provisions of sections 198 to 203 in the case of a listed company.\n25\n214(6)\nNon\u2011disclosure\nof interest by a director of a listed company.\n26\n215(2)\nContract\nby an interested officer of a listed company without approval of directors.\n27\n216(3)\nParticipation\nof interested director of a listed company in proceedings.\n28\n218(6)\nNon\u2011disclosure\nof directors' interest in contract appointing chief executive, managing agent\nor secretary in the case of a listed company.\n29\n220(8)\nNon\u2011maintenance\nand non\u2011production of register of directors' shareholding, etc.\n30\n229\nContravention\nof sections 226, 227 or 228 in the case of a listed company.\n31\n235(5)\nContravention\nof provisions relating to a treatment of surplus arising out of revaluati",
