    "title": "Power of the federal Government to alter schedules",
    "description": "Power of the federal Government to alter schedules\n\nCOMPANIES ORDINANCE 1984\nCOMPANIES\nORDINANCE 1984\n(ORDINANCE NO. XLVII OF 1984)\n[8th October, 1984]\nAn Ordinance to consolidate and\namend the law relating to companies and certain other associations.\nPART XVI\u2011\u2011SCHEDULES, TABLES, FORMS AND GENERAL\nRULES\n505. Power of the Federal\nGovernment to alter schedules.\u2011\u2011--The Federal Government may,\nby notification in the official Gazette, alter or add to any of the tables,\nregulations, requirements, forms and other provisions contained in any of the\nschedules, and such alterations or additions shall have effect as if enacted in\nthis Ordinance and shall come into force on the date of the notification,\nunless the notification otherwise directs.",
