    "title": "Power of the federal Government to permit use of Urdu words or abbreviations",
    "description": "Power of the federal Government to permit use of Urdu words or abbreviations\n\nCOMPANIES ORDINANCE 1984\nCOMPANIES\nORDINANCE 1984\n(ORDINANCE NO. XLVII OF 1984)\n[8th October, 1984]\nAn Ordinance to consolidate and\namend the law relating to companies and certain other associations.\nPART XVI\u2011\u2011SCHEDULES, TABLES, FORMS AND GENERAL\nRULES\n507. Power of the Federal Government to permit use of Urdu words or\nabbreviations. ---The Federal Government may, by notification in the\nofficial Gazette, permit use of an Urdu equivalent of any English word or term\nrequired to be used pursuant to or for the purposes of this Ordinance or an\nabbreviation of any such word or term instead of such word or term.",
