    "statute": "Companies Ordinance 1984",
    "section": "509",
    "title": "Amendment of Ordinance XVII of 1969",
    "description": "Amendment of Ordinance XVII of 1969\n\nCOMPANIES ORDINANCE 1984\nCOMPANIES\nORDINANCE 1984\n(ORDINANCE NO. XLVII OF 1984)\n[8th October, 1984]\nAn Ordinance to consolidate and\namend the law relating to companies and certain other associations.\nPART XVI\u2011\u2011REPEAL, SAVINGS,.ETC.\n509. Amendment of Ordinance\nXVII of 1969.\u2011\u2011As from the date of commencement of this\nOrdinance, sections 9, 21 and 28 of the Securities and Exchange Ordinance, 1969\n(XVII of 1969), shall have effect subject to the amendments specified in the\nEighth Schedule.",
