    "description": "Short title and extent\n\nLIMITATION ACT\nLIMITATION ACT\n(IX OF 1908)\n[7th August, 1908]\nAn Act to consolidate and amend the law for\nthe limitation of suits, and for other purposes.\nPART I\nPreliminary\n1. Short title, extent and commencement. (1)\nThis Act may be called the Limitation Act, 1908.\n(2) It extends to the whole\nof Pakistan.\n(3) This\nsection and Section 31 shall come into force at once. The rest of this Act\nshall come into force on the first day of January, 1909.",
