    "id": "sra-1",
    "statute": "Specific Relief Act 1877",
    "section": "1",
    "title": "Short title",
    "description": "Short title\n\nTHE SPECIFIC RELIEF ACT, 1877\nTHE SPECIFIC RELIEF ACT, 1877\n(I OF 1877)\nPART I\nPreliminary\n1. Short title.\nThis Act maybe called the Specific Relief Act, 1877.\nLocal extent. It\nextends to the whole of Pakistan.\nCommencement. And\nit shall come into force on the first day of May, 1877.",
    "punishment": null,
    "category": "civil",
