    "id": "sra-52",
    "statute": "Specific Relief Act 1877",
    "section": "52",
    "title": "Preventive relief how granted",
    "description": "Preventive relief how granted\n\nPART III\nTHE SPECIFIC RELIEF ACT, 1877\n(I OF 1877)\nPART III\nOF PREVENTIVE RELIEF\nCHAPTER IX\nOF INJUNCTIONS GENERALLY\n52. Preventive relief granted. Preventive relief is\ngranted at the discretion of the Court by injunction, temporary or perpetual.",
