    "description": "Presentment of cheque to charge any other person\n\nCHAPTER V\nCHAPTER V\nOF PRESENTMENT\n73. Presentment\nof cheques charge any other person. A cheque must, in order to charge any\nperson except the drawer, be presented within a reasonable time after delivery\nthereof by such person.",
