    "title": "Acceptance and payment without protest",
    "description": "Acceptance and payment without protest\n\nCHAPTER XI\nCHAPTER XI\nOF ACCEPTANCE AND PAYMENT FOR HONOUR AND\n116. Acceptance\nand payment without protest. A drawee in case of need may accept and pay the\nbill of exchange without previous protest.",
    "punishment": null,
