    "statute": "Transfer of Property Act 1882",
    "section": "54",
    "title": "Sale defined",
    "description": "Sale defined\n\nCHAPTER III\nTransfer of Property Act 1882\nCHAPTER III\nOF SALES OF IMMOVABLE PROPERTY\n54. \"Sale defined\". \"Sale\"\nis a transfer of ownership in exchange for a price paid or promised or part\npaid and part promised.",
