    "id": "tpa-96",
    "statute": "Transfer of Property Act 1882",
    "section": "96",
    "title": "Mortgage by deposit of title-deeds",
    "description": "Mortgage by deposit of title-deeds\n\nTRANSFER OF PROPERTY\nTRANSFER OF PROPERTY\nACT, 1882\nACT No. IV OF 1882 (17th February, 1882]\nCHAPTER IV\nRedemption\n96. Mortgage by deposit of title\u2011deeds. The\nprovisions hereinbefore contained which apply to a single mortgage shall, so\nfar as may be, apply to a mortgage by deposit of title\u2011deeds.\nSs. 95 and 96 were subs. by the Transfer of Property\n(Amdt.) Act, 1929 (20 of 1929), S. 48 for the original section 95.",
