    "title": "Appointment of arbitrator",
    "description": "Appointment of arbitrator\n\nCHAPTER IV\nTHE ARBITRATION ACT, 1940\n(X OF 1940)\n[11 March, 1940]\nAn\nAct to consolidate and amend the law relating to Arbitration.\nWHERE it is\nexpedient to consolidate and amend. the law relating to arbitration in\nPakistan.\nIt is hereby\nenacted as follows:\u2011\nCHAPTER IV\nARBITRATION\nIN SUITS\n22.\nAppointment of arbitrator. The arbitrator shall be appointed in such manner\nas may be agreed upon between the parties.",
    "punishment": null,
