    "section": "26",
    "title": "Application of chapter",
    "description": "Application of chapter\n\nCHAPTER V\nTHE ARBITRATION ACT, 1940\n(X OF 1940)\n[11 March, 1940]\nAn\nAct to consolidate and amend the law relating to Arbitration.\nWHERE it is\nexpedient to consolidate and amend. the law relating to arbitration in\nPakistan.\nIt is hereby\nenacted as follows:\u2011\nCHAPTER\nV\nGENERAL\n26.\nApplication of Chapter. Save as otherwise provided in this Act, the\nprovision of this Chapter shall apply to all arbitrations.",
    "punishment": null,
    "category": "civil",
