    "section": "48",
    "title": "Saving for pending references",
    "description": "Saving for pending references\n\nCHAPTER VII\nTHE ARBITRATION ACT, 1940\n(X OF 1940)\n[11 March, 1940]\nAn\nAct to consolidate and amend the law relating to Arbitration.\nWHERE it is\nexpedient to consolidate and amend. the law relating to arbitration in\nPakistan.\nIt is hereby\nenacted as follows:\u2011\nCHAPTER VII\nMISCELLANEOUS\n48.\nSaving for pending references. The provisions of this Act shall not apply\nto any reference pending at the commencement of this \"Act, to which the\nlaw in force immediately before the commencement of this Act shall,\nnotwithstanding any repeal affected by this Act, continue to apply.",
