    "description": "THE FOURTH SCHEDULE\nTHE ARBITRATION ACT, 1940\n(X OF 1940)\n[11 March, 1940]\nAn\nAct to consolidate and amend the law relating to Arbitration.\nWHERE it is\nexpedient to consolidate and amend. the law relating to arbitration in\nPakistan.\nIt is hereby\nenacted as follows:\u2011\nTHE FOURTH SCHEDULE\n[ENACTMENTS\nREPEALED. ENACTMENTS AMENDED.]\n[Rep. by the Repealing and\nAmending Act, 1945 (VI of 1945), Section 2 and First Schedule.]",
