    "id": "registration-act-5",
    "statute": "Registration Act 1908",
    "section": "5",
    "title": "Districts and sub-districts",
    "description": "Districts and sub-districts\n\nTHE REGISTRATION ACT 1908\nTHE REGISTRATION ACT 1908\n(XVI OF 1908)\n[18th December,\n1908]\nAn Act to\nconsolidate the enactments relating to the Registration of Document\nFor Statement of Objects and\nReasons, see Gazette of India, 1908. Pt. V. p. 325; for Report of Select\nCommittee, see i6 id, 1908, Pt. V, p. 387; and for Proceeding\u2011in -\nCouncil, see ibid, 1908, Pt. VI, pp. 148, 154 and 182.\nWHEREAS it is\nexpedient to consolidate the enactments relating to the registration of\ndocuments:\nIt is hereby\nenacted as follows:\u2011\u2011\nPART II\nOF THE REGISTRATION ESTABLISHMENT\n5. Districts\nand sub\u2011districts. (1) For the purposes of\nthis Act, the Provincial Government\u2011 shall form districts and sub\u2011districts,\nand shall prescribe, and may alter, the limits of such districts and sub\u2011districts.\n(2) The district\nand sub\u2011districts formed under this section, together with the limits\nthereof, and every alteration, of such limits, shall be notified in the\nOfficial Gazette.\n(3) Every such\nalteration shall take effect on such day after the date of the notification as\nis therein mentioned.\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000",
