    "id": "registration-act-26",
    "statute": "Registration Act 1908",
    "section": "26",
    "title": "Documents executed out of Pakistan, etc.",
    "description": "Documents executed out of Pakistan, etc.\n\nTHE REGISTRATION ACT 1908\nTHE REGISTRATION ACT 1908\n(XVI OF 1908)\n[18th December,\n1908]\nAn Act to\nconsolidate the enactments relating to the Registration of Document\nFor Statement of Objects and\nReasons, see Gazette of India, 1908. Pt. V. p. 325; for Report of Select\nCommittee, see i6 id, 1908, Pt. V, p. 387; and for Proceeding\u2011in -\nCouncil, see ibid, 1908, Pt. VI, pp. 148, 154 and 182.\nWHEREAS it is\nexpedient to consolidate the enactments relating to the registration of\ndocuments:\nIt is hereby\nenacted as follows:\u2011\u2011\nPART IV\nOF THE TIME OF PRESENTATION\n26. Documents\nexecuted out of the Provinces, etc. When a document\npurporting to have been executed by all or any of the parties out of Pakistan\nis not presented for registration till after the expiration of the time herein\na before prescribed in that behalf, the registration officer, if satisfied\u2011\u2011\n(a) that the\ninstrument was so executed; and\n(b) that it has\nbeen presented for registration within four months after its arrival in\nPakistan\nmay, on payment\nof the proper registration fee, accept such document for registration.\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000",
