    "id": "registration-act-30",
    "statute": "Registration Act 1908",
    "section": "30",
    "title": "Registration by registrars in certain cases",
    "description": "Registration by registrars in certain cases\n\nTHE REGISTRATION ACT 1908\nTHE REGISTRATION ACT 1908\n(XVI OF 1908)\n[18th December,\n1908]\nAn Act to\nconsolidate the enactments relating to the Registration of Document\nFor Statement of Objects and\nReasons, see Gazette of India, 1908. Pt. V. p. 325; for Report of Select\nCommittee, see i6 id, 1908, Pt. V, p. 387; and for Proceeding\u2011in -\nCouncil, see ibid, 1908, Pt. VI, pp. 148, 154 and 182.\nWHEREAS it is\nexpedient to consolidate the enactments relating to the registration of\ndocuments:\nIt is hereby\nenacted as follows:\u2011\u2011\nPART V\nOF THE PLACE OF REGISTRATION\n30.\nRegistration by Registrars in certain cases. (1)\nAny Registrar may in his discretion receive and register any document which\nmight be registered by any Sub\u2011Registrar subordinate to him.\n(2)\nNotwithstanding anything contained hi section 28 any Registrar may receive and\nregister any document without regard to be situation in any part of Pakistan of\nthe property to which the document relates if he is satisfied that there is\nsufficient cause for doing so.\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000",
