    "id": "registration-act-62",
    "statute": "Registration Act 1908",
    "section": "62",
    "title": "Procedure on presenting document in language unknown to registering officer",
    "description": "Procedure on presenting document in language unknown to registering officer\n\nTHE REGISTRATION ACT 1908\nTHE REGISTRATION ACT 1908\n(XVI OF 1908)\n[18th December,\n1908]\nAn Act to\nconsolidate the enactments relating to the Registration of Document\nFor Statement of Objects and\nReasons, see Gazette of India, 1908. Pt. V. p. 325; for Report of Select\nCommittee, see i6 id, 1908, Pt. V, p. 387; and for Proceeding\u2011in -\nCouncil, see ibid, 1908, Pt. VI, pp. 148, 154 and 182.\nWHEREAS it is\nexpedient to consolidate the enactments relating to the registration of\ndocuments:\nIt is hereby\nenacted as follows:\u2011\u2011\nPART XI\nOF THE DUTIES AND POWERS OF REGISTERING OFFICERS\n(B) As to the\nProcedure on admitting to Registration\n62. Procedure\non presenting document in language unknown to registering officer. (1) When a document is presented for registration under section 19,\nthe translation shall be transcribed in the register of documents of the nature\nof the original, and, together with the copy referred to in section 19, shall\nbe filed in the registration office.\n(2) the\nendorsements and certificate respectively mentioned in sections 59 and 60 shall\nbe made on the original, and for the purpose of making the copies and memoranda\nrequired by sections 57, 64, 65 and 66 the translation shall be treated as if\nit were the original.\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000",
