    "id": "registration-act-63",
    "statute": "Registration Act 1908",
    "section": "63",
    "title": "Power to administer oaths and records of substances of statements",
    "description": "Power to administer oaths and records of substances of statements\n\nTHE REGISTRATION ACT 1908\nTHE REGISTRATION ACT 1908\n(XVI OF 1908)\n[18th December,\n1908]\nAn Act to\nconsolidate the enactments relating to the Registration of Document\nFor Statement of Objects and\nReasons, see Gazette of India, 1908. Pt. V. p. 325; for Report of Select\nCommittee, see i6 id, 1908, Pt. V, p. 387; and for Proceeding\u2011in -\nCouncil, see ibid, 1908, Pt. VI, pp. 148, 154 and 182.\nWHEREAS it is\nexpedient to consolidate the enactments relating to the registration of\ndocuments:\nIt is hereby\nenacted as follows:\u2011\u2011\nPART XI\nOF THE DUTIES AND POWERS OF REGISTERING OFFICERS\n(B) As to the\nProcedure on admitting to Registration\n63. Power to\nadminister oaths and records of substance of statements. (1) Every registering officer may at his discretion administer an\noath to any person examined by him under the provisions of this Act.\n(2) Every such\nofficer may also at his discretion record a note of the substance of the\nstatement made by each such person and such statement shall be read over, or\n(if made in a language with which such person is not acquainted) interpreted to\nhim in a language with which the is acquainted, and, if he admit the\ncorrectness of such note, it shall be signed by the registering officer.\n(3) Every such\nnote so signed shall be admissible for the purpose of proving that the\nstatements therein recorded were made by the persons and under the\ncircumstances therein stated.\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000",
    "punishment": null,
    "category": "commercial",
    "isMajorCode": true
