    "id": "registration-act-78",
    "statute": "Registration Act 1908",
    "section": "78",
    "title": "Of the fees for registration, searches and copies",
    "description": "Of the fees for registration, searches and copies\n\nTHE REGISTRATION ACT 1908\nTHE REGISTRATION ACT 1908\n(XVI OF 1908)\n[18th December,\n1908]\nAn Act to\nconsolidate the enactments relating to the Registration of Document\nFor Statement of Objects and\nReasons, see Gazette of India, 1908. Pt. V. p. 325; for Report of Select\nCommittee, see i6 id, 1908, Pt. V, p. 387; and for Proceeding\u2011in -\nCouncil, see ibid, 1908, Pt. VI, pp. 148, 154 and 182.\nWHEREAS it is\nexpedient to consolidate the enactments relating to the registration of\ndocuments:\nIt is hereby\nenacted as follows:\u2011\u2011\nPART XIII\nOF THE FEES FOR REGISTRATION, SEARCHES AND COPIES\n78. Fees to\nbe fixed by Provincial Government. The Provincial\nGovernment shall prepare a table of fees payable\u2011\u2011\n(a) for the\nregistration of documents;\n(b) for\nsearching the registers;\n(c) for making or\ngranting copies of reasons, entries or documents, before, on or after\nregistration; and of extra or additional fees payable\u2011\u2011\n(d) for every\nregistration under section 30;\n(e) for the\nissue of commission;\n(f) for filing\ntranslations;\n(g) for attending\nat private residences;\n(h) for the safe\ncustody and return of documents; and\n(i) for such\nother matters as appear to the Provincial Government necessary to effect the\npurpose of this Act.\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000",
