    "id": "registration-act-91",
    "statute": "Registration Act 1908",
    "section": "91",
    "title": "Inspection and copies of such documents",
    "description": "Inspection and copies of such documents\n\nTHE REGISTRATION ACT 1908\nTHE REGISTRATION ACT 1908\n(XVI OF 1908)\n[18th December,\n1908]\nAn Act to\nconsolidate the enactments relating to the Registration of Document\nFor Statement of Objects and\nReasons, see Gazette of India, 1908. Pt. V. p. 325; for Report of Select\nCommittee, see i6 id, 1908, Pt. V, p. 387; and for Proceeding\u2011in -\nCouncil, see ibid, 1908, Pt. VI, pp. 148, 154 and 182.\nWHEREAS it is\nexpedient to consolidate the enactments relating to the registration of\ndocuments:\nIt is hereby\nenacted as follows:\u2011\u2011\nPART XV\nMISCELLANEOUS\nExemptions from Act\n91.\nInspection and copies of such documents. Subject to\nsuch rules and the previous payment. of such fees as the Provincial Government\nprescribed in this behalf, all documents and maps mentioned in section 90,\nclauses (a), (b), (c) and (e) and all registers of the documents mentioned in\nclause (d), shall he open to the inspection of any person applying to inspect\nthe same, and, subject as aforesaid, copies of such documents shall be given to\nall persons applying for such copies.\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000\n\u0000",
