    "id": "court-fees-act-16",
    "statute": "Court Fees Act 1870",
    "section": "16",
    "title": "THE COUR FEES ACT 1870",
    "description": "Additional fee where respondent takes objection to unappealed part of decree\n\nTHE COUR FEES ACT 1870\nTHE COUR FEES ACT 1870\nACT No. VII of 1870\n[11th March, 1870]\nCHAPTER III\nFEES IN OTHER COURTS AND IN PUBLIC OFFICES\n16. [Additional\nfee where respondent takes objection to un- appealed part of decree.] Rep. by\nthe Code of Civil Procedure, 1908 (V of 1908).",
