    "title": "and 28 not apply to probates or letters of administration",
    "description": "Section 6 and 28 not apply to probates or letters of administration\n\nTHE COUR FEES ACT 1870\nTHE COUR FEES ACT 1870\nACT No. VII of 1870\n[11th March, 1870]\n[CHAPTER IIIA]\n(Chapter\nIIIA ins. by s. 6 of the Probate and Administration Act, 1875 (13 of 1875).)\nPROBATES, LETTERS OF ADMINISTRATION AND CERTIFICATES\nOF ADMINISTRATION\n19K. Sections 6 and 28 not to apply:, to probates or\nletters of administration: (Ins.\nby the Court\u2011\u2011fees Amendment Act, 1899 (11 of 1899), s. 2.)[ Nothing in section 6 or section 28 shall apply to pro bates or\nletters of administration.]",
