    "title": "THE SUITS VALUATION ACT, 1887",
    "description": "Extent and commencement of part I\n\nTHE SUITS VALUATION ACT, 1887\nTHE SUITS VALUATION ACT, 1887\n(VII OF 1887)\n[11th February, 18871\nPART I SUITS RELATING TO LAND\n2. Extent and commencement of Part I. This part shall extend to such local\nareas, and come into force therein on such dates, as the Provincial Government,\nby notification in the official Gazette, directs.\nPunjab Amendment:\nThe heading \"guit relating to\nland\" of Part I was omitted.\nPunjab Act, XIII of 1942, (22.11.1942).",
    "punishment": null,
    "category": "civil",
