    "section": "8",
    "title": "Court-fee value and jurisdictional value to be the same in certain suits",
    "description": "Court-fee value and jurisdictional value to be the same in certain suits\n\nTHE SUITS VALUATION ACT, 1887\nTHE SUITS VALUATION ACT, 1887\n(VII OF 1887)\n[11th February, 18871\nPART II OTHER SUITS\n8. Court\u2011fee value and jurisdictional\nvalue to be the same in certain suits. Where ha suits other those referred to in the Court Fees Act, 1870,\nsection 7, paragraphs (v) (vi), and paragraph (x). clause (d), Court\u2011fees,\nare payable ad valorem under the Court Fees Act, 1870, the value as\ndeterminable for the computation of Court\u2011fees and the value for purposes\nof jurisdiction shall be the same.",
