    "id": "general-clauses-act-13-a",
    "statute": "General Clauses Act 1897",
    "section": "13-A",
    "title": "References to the Sovereign",
    "description": "References to the Sovereign\n\nTHE GENERAL CLAUSES ACT\nTHE GENERAL CLAUSES ACT\n(X of 1897)\nGENERAL RULES OF\nCONSTRUCTIONS\n13\u2011A. References to the\nSovereign: Inserted by the\nRepealing and Amending Act, 1919 (18 of 1919), Section 2 and Sch. I, amended by\nAO. 1937 and omitted by AO. 1961, Art. 2 and Sch. (with effect from the 23rd\nMarch, 1956).",
    "punishment": null,
    "category": "civil",
